# Try the API from VS Code (REST Client), Visual Studio or Rider.
@api = http://localhost:5080

### The three feeling dials
GET {{api}}/api/feelings

### Featured journeys for "Departing soon"
GET {{api}}/api/journeys?featured=true

### Zen + romantic + luxury
GET {{api}}/api/discover?zenWild=15&romanticAdventurous=25&luxuryRaw=10&take=4

### Wild + adventurous + raw
GET {{api}}/api/discover?zenWild=90&romanticAdventurous=90&luxuryRaw=80

### One journey in full
GET {{api}}/api/journeys/japan-koyo-trails

### Reserve a seat
POST {{api}}/api/enquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "journeySlug": "japan-koyo-trails",
  "fullName": "Ananya Rao",
  "email": "ananya@example.com",
  "phone": "+91 98200 00000",
  "travellers": 2,
  "note": "Celebrating our anniversary"
}

### Health
GET {{api}}/health
